<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_ION_title">Terran Gemini Missiles - Ion</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_ION_short">Gemini Ion</text>
<text name="weapon_GEMINI_MISSILES_ION_desc">A light missile system that excels when its versatility is utilized properly.</text>
