<!-- TERRAN SPIDER MINE -->
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_1_NAME">Terran Spider Mine Qt.1</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_1_SHORT">Spider Mine I</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_1_DESC">Deploys a Terran Spider Mine. Mines burrow when set and are not player-controllable unless redeployed.</text>

<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_2_NAME">Terran Spider Mine Qt.2</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_2_SHORT">Spider Mine II</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_2_DESC">Deploys a pair of Terran Spider Mines. Mines burrow when set and are not player-controllable unless redeployed.</text>

<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_3_NAME">Terran Spider Mine Qt.3</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_3_SHORT">Spider Mine III</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_3_DESC">Deploys a set of three Terran Spider Mines. Mines burrow when set and are not player-controllable unless redeployed.</text>

<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_SET_NAME">Terran Spider Mine</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_SET_SHORT">Spider Mine</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_SET_DESC">Mines burrow when set and are not player-controllable unless redeployed. Mines will automatically seek out targets and detonate when an enemy is nearby.</text>

<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_MINE_NAME">Terran Spider Mine</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_MINE_SHORT">Spider Mine</text>
<text name="drone_TERRAN_SPIDER_MINE_DESC">Mines will automatically seek out targets and detonate when an enemy is nearby. Redeploying a mine will make it controllable again.</text>

<!-- TERRAN CREW -->
<text name="crew_TERRAN_MARINE_NAME">Terran Marine</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_MARINE_SHORT">Marine</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_MARINE_DESC">Basic Terran soldier equipped with powered armor and a rapid-fire C-14 rifle.  
Powered Armor Stats:
-Minor fire and damage resistance
-Resistant to suffocation|
-Reduced movement speed.</text>

<text name="crew_TERRAN_MEDIC_NAME">Terran Medic</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_MEDIC_SHORT">Medic</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_MEDIC_DESC">Terran field medic trained to supress enemy forces and keep infantry alive in combat zones.
Powered Armor Stats:
-Minor fire and damage resistance
-Resistant to suffocation
-Reduced movement speed.</text>

<text name="crew_TERRAN_FIREBAT_NAME">Terran Firebat</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_FIREBAT_SHORT">Firebat</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_FIREBAT_DESC">Flame-wielding shock trooper built for close combat and clearing out enemy infantry.
Powered Armor Stats:
-Immune to fire damage
-Minor damage resistance
-Resistant to suffocation
-Reduced movement speed.</text>

<text name="crew_TERRAN_GHOST_NAME">Terran Ghost</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_GHOST_SHORT">Ghost</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_GHOST_DESC">Cloaked specialist skilled in sabotage, psionics, and high-value target elimination.
Hostile Environment Suit Stats:
-Resistant to suffocation
-Increased movement speed.</text>

<text name="crew_TERRAN_CIVILIAN_NAME">Terran Civilian</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_CIVILIAN_SHORT">Civilian</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_CIVILIAN_DESC">Civilians are quick learners, but ill equipped for combat.</text>

<text name="crew_TERRAN_SPIDER_SET_NAME">Terran Spider Mine</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_SPIDER_SET_SHORT">Spider Mine</text>
<text name="crew_TERRAN_SPIDER_SET_DESC">[[Need terran_spider_set Description]][CREW]</text>

