<!-- TERRAN AUGMENTS -->
<text name="system_lily_system_bracers_NAME">System Bracers</text>
<text name="system_lily_system_bracers_DESC">Passively protects your systems from damage, redirecting system damage towards itself instead (As long as it isn't destroyed itself).</text>

<text name="aug_TERRAN_WRAITH_BATTERY_NAME">Apollo Reactor</text>
<text name="aug_TERRAN_WRAITH_BATTERY_DESC">High yield uranium reactors designed by the Terran Confederacy.  

OVERCHARGED: Systems powered by the reactor recover more quickly from ion damage and have increased performance.
- Cloak: Reduced Downtime.
- Engines: Increased evasion and ftl charge rate.
- Oxygen: Automated fire supression. Increased refill speed.

UPGRADE: Battery System (+2 max level)</text>

<text name="aug_TERRAN_SHIP_ARMOR_LIGHT_NAME">Light Armor Plating</text>
<text name="aug_TERRAN_SHIP_ARMOR_LIGHT_DESC">Light neosteel hulls and reinforced structural bracers provide better maneuverability at a cost of durability.  

ARMORED: System Bracers have a chance to block incoming damage (System Bracer Health * 20%)

BONUS: Evasion +2% per engine level
    
STRAIF: Increase Accuracy and Projectile Speed (Accuracy +0.5% per Evasion)</text>

<text name="aug_TERRAN_SHIP_ARMOR_MEDIUM_NAME">Medium Armor Plating</text>
<text name="aug_TERRAN_SHIP_ARMOR_MEDIUM_DESC">Layered neosteel hulls and reinforced structural plating make this ship more durable, at a slight cost to maneuverability.  
    
ARMORED: System Bracers have a chance to block incoming damage (System Bracer Health * 20%)

UPGRADE: System Bracers (+1 max level)

PENALTY: Evasion -1% per engine level</text>

<text name="aug_TERRAN_SHIP_ARMOR_HEAVY_NAME">Heavy Armor Plating</text>
<text name="aug_TERRAN_SHIP_ARMOR_HEAVY_DESC">Layered neosteel hulls and reinforced structural plating make this ship more durable, at a significan cost to maneuverability.

ARMORED: System Bracers have a chance to block incoming damage (System Bracer Health * 20%)

UPGRADE: System Bracers (+2 max level)

PENALTY: Evasion -2% per engine level</text>

<text name="aug_SC_DETECTOR_NAME">Advanced Sensor Suite</text>
<!-- Protoss could be called Advanced Sensor Array, Zerg could be something biological -->
<text name="aug_SC_DETECTOR_DESC">Advanced sensors allow this ship to track enemy targets more effectively. For each active level of sensors, weapons will charge while enemies are cloaked at a cumulative 25% speed.
    
UPGRADE: Sensors +1 (+1 max level)

DETECTOR: Projectiles +2.5% accuracy per sensor level. Missiles gain double that.</text>